{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Spirit [Fmaj7]of[F7]the [Gm]liv[F]ing [Gm7]God,
[F]Fall a[Bb]fresh [C7]on [F]me!
[F]Spirit [Am7]of[F]the [C7]liv[F]ing [Bb]God,
[Gm]Fall a[Am]fresh [C7]on [F]me!
[Bb]Break me, [F]melt me, [G7]mold [Em]me, [C]fill [C7]me!
[F]Spirit [F7]of [D7]the [Gm]liv[Am]ing [Gm]God,
[F]Fall a[Bb]fresh [D7]on [F]me!
{end_of_verse}
